# Sangala Mosaic — a single self-contained HTML file plus assets. Nothing to build.
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak
~$*

# Archived doc versions — the main Documents folder shows only the current version
Documents/.Archive/

# ARCHIVE FOLDERS DO NOT BELONG IN A REPOSITORY. Git already holds every prior version of every
# tracked file - that is what it is for - so an Archive inside it stores the old versions twice.
# Archive is a Dropbox idea, for folders that have no history of their own. 81 files and ~38 MB
# across the three repositories were tracked this way before 2026-08-30. The folders stay on disk;
# they are simply not carried.
Archive/
.Archive/
